 Oct 12, the September to October pair has come in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, the most of any pair here. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in August to September and 38% in January to February. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 176% of normal. Grid 24461 had its driest year in 1988 at 60%.</p>"}
